  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong>  <span style=\"color: #000000;\">has released the Result / Rank Card for the Bihar ITI Competitive Admission Test 2026. Applications for the Bihar ITI CAT 2026 were accepted from 16 March 2026 to 27 April 2026. The written examination was held on 17 May 2026. Candidates who appeared for this examination can download their Bihar ITI CAT Result / Rank Card 2026 from the link given below.</span></span></span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Bihar Combined Entrance Competitive Examination Board (BCECEB)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Bihar ITI-CAT Result / Rank Card 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>16 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date : <strong>27 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>27 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Date :&nbsp;<strong>29-30 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\">Exam Date : </span><strong><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\">17 May 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Admit Card : <strong>10 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key : <strong>Available Soon</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Result / Rank Card : <strong>04 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EBC Candidates : <strong>Rs. 750/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST Candidates : <strong>Rs. 100/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PH Candidate : <strong>Rs. 430/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Bihar ITI-CAT Online Form 2026 : Age Limit</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 August 2026</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>14 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>17 Years ( MMT &amp; MT)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>N/A</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per Bihar ITI-CAT Admission Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bihar ITI-CAT Admissions 2026 : Course Details</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Course Name&nbsp;</strong></span>: Industrial Training Institute Competitive Admission Test (I.T.I.C.A.T) 2026</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Exam Conduct</span>&nbsp;</strong>: Bihar Combined Entrance Competitive Examination Board (BCECEB)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Bihar ITI-CAT Admissions 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates who have passed their Class 10<sup>th</sup> (Matriculation) level of Examination from nay recognized board will b eligible for this Combined Entrance Examination.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download Bihar ITI CAT Result / Rank Card 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Open on the region wise&nbsp;<strong>Download Result / Rank Card</strong>&nbsp;link from the&nbsp;<strong>Important Links&nbsp;</strong>box placed below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates will be redirected to a new page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">In this page, candidates have to fill up the required fields given as following:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Registration ID/ Roll Number/ Name</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Father’s Name (In case of searching by name)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Captcha code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">And Click on&nbsp;<strong>Search</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After submitting the correct details, applicants will be able to download the Result / Rank Card.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Documents to be Uploaded for Bihar ITI CAT Admission 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Matric (10th) Marksheet – For 10th Passed</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Matric (10th) Admit Card – For 10th Appearing</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Aadhar Card Number</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Applicant Passport Size Photo With Name And Date. (Date of Taken Photograph)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Applicant Signature – Hindi &amp; English</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Active E-Mail ID – For OTP Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Active Mobile Number – For Confirmation Message</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Residence Certificate</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Caste Certificate – For BC / EBC / SC / ST</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Bihar ITI-CAT Application Form 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Selection will be based on Online CBT Examination.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10p